   "question": "",
   "quote": "What do you think of adding shared locking to our lock checking machinery? Since we now take a shared lock while inside a separate lock which is released while the shared lock continues to be held, it would require us to make a modification to make sure we're popping the correct lock being released.",
   "request": "add shared locking to lock checking machinery and support non-LIFO lock popping in DEBUG_LOCKORDER",
   "status": "fixed",
